格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Minimal Windows agent preset + Git Bash tool for DeepSeek Harness: gitbash & pwsh & str_replace_editor, drop-in replacement for the official minimal preset on win32 / DeepSeek Harness 极简模式（Windows）Agent 预设 + Git Bash 工具：Git Bash + PowerShell + str_replace_editor 三工具，官方 minimal 预设","id":"gh:1333804850","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-preset-minimal-windows","slug":"zeroa234/dsh-preset-minimal-windows","topics":["agent-preset","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-external","dsh-plugin","git-bash","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Minimal Windows agent preset + Git Bash tool for DeepSeek Harness: gitbash & pwsh & str_replace_edit"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"or, drop-in replacement for the official minimal preset on win32 / DeepSeek Harness 极简模式（Windows）Age"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"nt 预设 + Git Bash 工具：Git Bash + PowerShell + str_replace_editor 三工具，官方 minimal 预设"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-preset-minimal-windows"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**极简模式（Windows）** — DeepSeek Harness 的 Windows 版极简 Agent 预设 + Git Bash 工具。\n**Minimal Windows agent p"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"reset + Git Bash tool for DeepSeek Harness.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"官方 `minimal` 预设的 shell 是持久 bash PTY（`dsh-terminal-bash` 硬编码 `/bin/bash`），Windows 上不可用。\n本仓库提供其 Window"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"s 替代：**Git Bash + PowerShell + str_replace_editor** 三工具，无持久 shell，每次调用起新进程。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The official `minimal` preset ships a persistent bash PTY stack (`dsh-terminal-bash` hardcodes `/bin"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"/bash`) that does not work on Windows.\nThis repo provides the Windows replacement: **Git Bash + Powe"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"rShell + str_replace_editor** — no persistent shell, a fresh process per call."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 中文说明 · Chinese"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 特性 · Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| 工具 Tool | 说明 Description |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| `gitbash` | 通过 `ctx.subprocess` 直接拉起 Git for Windows 的 `bash.exe -c`，自动探测安装路径（`%ProgramFiles%\\Git\\"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"bin\\bash.exe` → `usr\\bin` → x86 → PATH）；输出截断 + spill 落盘；超时终止（默认 120s / 上限 600s）；零外部依赖。Spawns Git for"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" Windows' `bash.exe -c` via `ctx.subprocess`, auto-probing install paths; output truncation + spill "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"files; timeout kill (default 120s / cap 600s); zero external dependencies. |\n| `pwsh` | 官方 `@deepsee"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"k-ai/dsh-tool-pwsh`，走宿主 `ctx.shell`（win32 下由 `dsh-pwsh-sandbox` 支撑），受文件沙箱约束。Official `@deepseek-ai/d"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"sh-tool-pwsh` over the host `ctx.shell` (backed by `dsh-pwsh-sandbox` on win32), sandbox-constrained"},{"id":"p9s7","text":". |\n| `str_replace_editor` | 官方字符串替换文件编辑器（与 fs-local 共享隔离 realm）。Official string-replace file editor"},{"id":"p9s8","text":" (shares the isolated `fs` realm with fs-local). |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- 固定 persona（`complete: true`），不注入运行时上下文，无上下文压缩——与官方 `minimal` 相同的极简哲学。Fixed persona (`complete: tru"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"e`), no runtime context, no compaction — the same minimal philosophy as the official `minimal`.\n- 非 "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"Windows 部署上自动跳过 `pwsh` 行（`disabled: process.platform !== 'win32'`）。The `pwsh` row is skipped automat"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ically on non-Windows platforms."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 安装 · Installation"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"#### 方式一：复制预设目录（推荐，单步）· Method 1: copy the preset directory (recommended, one step)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"把 `preset/minimal-windows` 整个目录复制到 `$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets/` 下（`$DSH_HOME` 默认是 `~/.dsh`，配置过则是 `E:\\"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nimal-windows` 整个目录复制到 `$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets/` 下（`$DSH_HOME` 默认是 `~/.dsh`，配置过则是 `E:\\agent\\dsh`）："},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Copy the whole `preset/minimal-windows` directory into `$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets/` (`$DSH_HOME` defa"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"eset/minimal-windows` directory into `$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets/` (`$DSH_HOME` defaults to `~/.dsh`):"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"预设内的 `tool-gitbash` 行以**相对路径**引用 `./lib/gitbash.js`，插件文件随目录一起走，无需任何 profile 安装。重启 harness（或新会话）后，在预设"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"列表选择「极简模式（Windows）」。"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The preset's `tool-gitbash` row references `./lib/gitbash.js` by a **relative path**, so the plugin "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"travels with the directory and no profile install is needed. Restart the harness (or start a new ses"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"sion) and pick **极简模式（Windows）** in the preset list."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"#### 方式二：bundle 全局安装（可选）· Method 2: install the bundle host-wide (optional)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"仓库根目录的 `gitbash-tool/` 是标准 bundle 包（`@dsh-external/dsh-tool-gitbash`），想在所有预设的会话里都用上 `gitbash` 可以全局装："},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`gitbash-tool/` is a standard bundle package (`@dsh-external/dsh-tool-gitbash`); install it host-wid"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"e to get `gitbash` in every preset's sessions:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"此时预设里的相对路径行与宿主 bundle 注册的 `gitbash` 工具同名共存（预设层遮蔽宿主层），行为一致，无需二选一。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The preset's relative-path row and the host bundle's `gitbash` coexist under the same name (the pres"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"et layer shadows the host layer); behavior is identical, no need to choose."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 与官方 minimal 的差异 · Differences from the official `minimal`"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| | 官方 `minimal` | 本预设 This preset |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Shell | 持久 bash PTY（`dsh-terminal` + `dsh-terminal-bash` + `dsh-tool-bash-persistent`）Persistent b"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ash PTY | `gitbash` + `pwsh`，每次调用全新进程 Fresh process per call |\n| 文件编辑 File editing | `str_replace_ed"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"itor` | 不变 Same |\n| 平台 Platform | Linux（`/bin/bash` 硬编码） | Windows（win32） |\n| Persona | \"You are a h"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"elpful software engineer assistant.\" | 同上 + 提示使用 gitbash / pwsh Same + hints to use gitbash / pwsh |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### 配置 · Configuration"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`bashPath` 可选：不想用自动探测时，在预设的 `agent.cordis.yml` 或 profile patch 里覆盖："},{"id":"p29s1","text":"`bashPath` is optional — override it in the preset's `agent.cordis.yml` or a profile patch to skip a"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"optional — override it in the preset's `agent.cordis.yml` or a profile patch to skip auto-detection:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### 注意 · Notes"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- `gitbash` 直接经 `ctx.subprocess` 执行，**不经过文件沙箱**（无 sandbox 集成），命令以 harness 进程权限运行；`pwsh` 则受沙箱约束（读模式 C"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"onstrainedLanguage、管道 EPERM 等）。`gitbash` runs directly through `ctx.subprocess` **without the file s"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"andbox** (no sandbox integration), with harness-process privileges; `pwsh` is sandbox-constrained (C"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"onstrainedLanguage in read-only mode, pipe EPERM, etc.).\n- 两个 shell 均为无状态：`cd`、环境变量等不跨调用保留。Both shel"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"ls are stateless: `cd` and environment variables do not persist across calls."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### 仓库结构 · Repository layout"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### 许可证 · License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
